# insta writes a pending snapshot here when a snapshot test fails. Review it with
# `cargo insta review`; never commit it.
*.snap.new
*.pending-snap
# cargo-mutants output.
mutants.out*/
# cargo-fuzz output (this package's fuzz project and the capstone's).
**/fuzz/target/
**/fuzz/corpus/
**/fuzz/artifacts/
**/fuzz/coverage/
